OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin patches see a bright side
OL,4,Ato scorching summer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We got rain in May which let the
OL,7,Fpumpkins germinate and that's the
OL,8,Fcritical bit for us," says Rob, who is
OL,9,Fa third-generation farmer.
